      "writtenOn": "2024-05-03T01:04:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nobody really uses the blueprint variable directly. The board makefiles use the variable MALLOC_SVELTE :\u003d true and that still enables the low memory allocator. After this change, you can also use MALLOC_LOW_MEMORY :\u003d true which is a little more intention revealing.\n\nBut before and after, nobody should see any differences on Wear/Auto/TV. If you enabled the low memory allocator before, you will get it after.",
